  unitName: "Deemo and the Girl (5\u2605)"
  unitId: 50564
  unitNumber: 642
  description: An amnesiac girl from the foreign land of Grand Gaia and Deemo, the
    strange being that saved her. Thinking there may be clues to the girl's past
    in Grand Gaia, the two decided to go and look. However, they found themselves
    landing in the middle of a war between the gods and man. Without any other choice,
    the girl armed herself with a rapier. Together with Deemo, she fought back gods
    and monsters alike, and it's said the two ventured around to countless villages
    and came to touch the hearts of many people.
  summonDesc: So this is Grand Gaia.<br>I've never been here before!<br>Is it OK
    if I look around?
  fusionDesc: What a useful technique you have.<br>It'd be nice if we could use this<br>to
    help our trees grow, too.
  evoDesc: Your wings are pretty, Deemo.<br>They're so big and white.<br>You look
    even cooler than before!
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
